[{"path":"README.md","fileType":"docs","lines":[{"lineNumber":1,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"[![CI Status](https://github.com/AY2627S1-CS2103T-T16-4/tp/workflows/Java%20CI/badge.svg)](https://github.com/AY2627S1-CS2103T-T16-4/tp/actions)","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":2,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-23T01:10:16","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":3,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"![Ui](docs/images/Ui.png)","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-23T01:10:16","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":4,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-23T01:10:16","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":5,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"# GitMate","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":6,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":7,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"**GitMate** is a desktop application designed for NUS students to organize, manage, and retrieve contact details across multiple project teams and student organizations.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":8,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":9,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"* It is tailored for students taking modules with group project components (such as CS2103/T) and CCAs, who need to keep track of a diverse and changing set of teammates.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":10,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"* It is **optimized for fast typists** via a Command Line Interface (CLI), while maintaining the benefits of a Graphical User Interface (GUI) created with JavaFX.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":11,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"* It is written in an **object-oriented programming (OOP)** style in Java, adapted from the [AddressBook Level 3 (AB3)](https://se-education.org/addressbook-level3) brownfield codebase.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":12,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":13,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"---","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":14,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":15,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"### Core Value Proposition","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":16,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":17,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"GitMate helps NUS students rapidly track and access group project teammates\u0027 details through an intuitive, conversational command interface tailored for fast typists.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":18,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":19,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"### Key Features (MVP)","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":20,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":21,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"* **Team Segmentation**: Group contacts into distinct, named project teams or CCA committees.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":22,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"* **Project-Critical Fields**: Store developer- and student-specific fields like GitHub handles, Telegram handles, and project roles alongside standard contact information.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":23,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"* **Rapid Retrieval**: Search teammates by name, skill, or role instantly across individual teams or the entire roster.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":24,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"* **Member Status Tracking**: Tag teammate availability (e.g., active tasks, \"MIA\") to monitor team health during critical project sprints.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":25,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":26,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"---","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":27,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":28,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"### Documentation","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":29,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":30,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"* **User Guide**: Refer to our User Guide for detailed command formats, cheat sheets, and practical examples.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":31,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"* **Developer Guide**: Refer to our Developer Guide for architecture diagrams, component breakdown, and design patterns.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":32,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16:23:53","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":33,"author":{"gitId":"mannymacman"},"content":"---","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-30T16